{
  "skillId": "windows-desktop-build",
  "name": "Windows Desktop Build",
  "description": "Tauri 2 / React / TypeScript / Vite / Rust build for Windows x64, bundling, and installer generation. Runs as a cross-build from a non-Windows host or natively on a Windows host. Produces artifact-production evidence only; it never claims native Windows runtime validation.",
